          "Examplepublic class Main {\n\tpublic static void main(String ar[]) {\n\t\tString s = \"Computer\";\n\t\tSystem.out.println(s.startsWith(\"C\"));// true\n\t\tSystem.out.println(s.endsWith(\"r\"));// true\n\t}\n}\nCompile and Run",
          "Output:"
