        "heading": "Example 5: SortedSet Operations",
        "paragraphs": [
          "In this example, we are performing SortedSet operations like headSet(), subSet(), and tailSet().",
          "Output:"
        ],
        "code": [
          "import java.util.*;  \nclass Main {  \n public static void main(String args[]){  \n  TreeSet<String> set = new TreeSet<String>();  \n  set.add(\"A\");  \n  set.add(\"B\");  \n  set.add(\"C\");  \n  set.add(\"D\");  \n  set.add(\"E\");  \n\n  System.out.println(\"Initial Set: \" + set);  \n  System.out.println(\"Head Set: \" + set.headSet(\"C\"));  \n  System.out.println(\"SubSet: \" + set.subSet(\"A\", \"E\"));  \n  System.out.println(\"TailSet: \" + set.tailSet(\"C\"));  \n }  \n}",
          "Intial Set: [A, B, C, D, E]\nHead Set: [A, B]\nSubSet: [A, B, C, D]\nTailSet: [C, D, E]"
        ]
